---
title: Test Onion Soup
servings: 4
---
-- test fixture, not a real recipe

= Base =
Slice @onions{4%large} thinly. Melt @butter{50%g} in a #large pot{} over medium heat.

Add the onions and @salt{1/2%tsp}, then stir for ~{10%minutes} until soft.

Add another @butter{2%tbsp} and cook for ~caramelise{40%minutes}, stirring occasionally.

= Finish =
Pour in @beef stock{1.5%l} and @thyme{some}(fresh, leaves only). Simmer for ~{1/2%hour}.

Season with @pepper and serve.
